{"id":"eaff3a195dfe9200","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-zfc-domain-closed-class.md","title":"ZFC Domain Closed Class","display":"df-zfc-domain-closed-class — ZFC Domain Closed Class","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-domain-closed-class","aliases":["58-df-zfc-domain-closed-class"],"display":"df-zfc-domain-closed-class — ZFC Domain Closed Class","depends_on":["[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-domain-closed-class"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-domain-closed-class</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-domain-closed-class — ZFC Domain Closed Class"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c5203cd487b6ba6d\" href=\"?note=c5203cd487b6ba6d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-domain.md\">../batch09/58-df-domain.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> (class)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Class}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Class}_S\\)</span> (definable-class predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" href=\"?note=ca2a9c9166fa8cce\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-class.md\">../batch11/58-df-class.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{dom}\">\\(\\operatorname{dom}\\)</span> (relation-domain operator, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"c5203cd487b6ba6d\" href=\"?note=c5203cd487b6ba6d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-domain.md\">../batch09/58-df-domain.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DomainClosedClass}\">\\(\\operatorname{DomainClosedClass}\\)</span> (predicate defined below)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}domain\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\operatorname{DomainClosedClass}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land \\forall r\\;(r\\in C\\to\\operatorname{dom}(r)\\in C)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}domain\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\operatorname{DomainClosedClass}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land \\forall r\\;(r\\in C\\to\\operatorname{dom}(r)\\in C)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Closure is under the total set operation that extracts first coordinates from ordered pairs occurring in its argument. The class guard prevents an arbitrary metalevel collection from satisfying the name accidentally.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-class.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5203cd487b6ba6d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch11/58-df-class.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca2a9c9166fa8cce","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Class}_S$ (definable-class predicate, see [[../batch11/58-df-class.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-domain.md","status":"resolved","id":"c5203cd487b6ba6d","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{dom}$ (relation-domain operator, see [[../batch09/58-df-domain.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Class}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{dom}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{DomainClosedClass}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}domain\\text{-}closed\\text{-}class} \\vdash \\operatorname{DomainClosedClass}(C)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{Class}_S(C)\\land \\forall r\\;(r\\in C\\to\\operatorname{dom}(r)\\in C)","display":true}],"bytes":1065,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1858","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-zfc-domain-closed-class.md|58-df-zfc-domain-closed-class]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["ca2a9c9166fa8cce","c5203cd487b6ba6d"]}